s don't","start":123.05999755859375},{"end":129.17999267578125,"text":"And if you can't see the bucket from the trees","start":126.0999984741211},{"end":132.6999969482422,"text":"Baby, you should know that you can't be free","start":129.17999267578125},{"end":138,"text":"Do you know what it's like to be me?","start":132.72000122070312},{"end":143.16000366210938,"text":"Do you even want to hear, listen, or understand?","start":138.44000244140625},{"end":146.5399932861328,"text":"What it's like to be unloved","start":143.9199981689453},{"end":149.72000122070312,"text":"Feel unjust","start":148.0399932861328},{"end":153.22000122070312,"text":"Have the whole world staring at you","start":150.16000366210938},{"end":158.9600067138672,"text":"Cause they can see you're on the rush to be unloved","start":153.22000122070312},{"end":162.55999755859375,"text":"Be just a","start":159.82000732421875},{"end":165.6199951171875,"text":"Cryptomaniac in anxiety","start":163.02000427246094},{"end":170.24000549316406,"text":"Do you want to feel unloved?","start":167.16000366210938},{"end":172.22000122070312,"text":"I didn't think so","start":170.89999389648438},{"end":179.33999633789062,"text":"So let me take a breath and have some gratitude for what you see in front of you","start":172.75999450683594},{"end":183.27999877929688,"text":"You don't have to be the number one thing you're trying to fulfill at all","start":179.33999633789062},{"end":189.36000061035156,"text":"To understand you've got the good stick and the amount of people that care for you","start":183.27999877929688},{"end":193.4199981689453,"text":"Oh, it's so true","start":190.4199981689453}],"unlock":{"card":"card-226","fragments":10},"chartVersion":"v6_deluxe","chartReport":{"version":"v6_deluxe","bpm":106.02,"catalogBpm":102,"tempoConfidence":0.55,"beats":344,"bars":85,"repeatedBars":8,"povTimes":[72.737,168.368],"typeCounts":{"tap":365,"hold":26,"swipe":18,"lift":21,"hold-swipe":10,"slide":14,"accent":7,"mine":17,"zig